      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>P37 Control and status registers - Digital task
Scaled: an 8-bit mtvec register and the MIE/MPIE flip-flops with trap and mret behaviour.
Allowed parts: gates + multiplexer/decoder parts + flip-flops
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string>
        </entry>
